OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudier
OL,6,Facross many eastern areas and the far
OL,7,Fnorth overnight with a few showers,
OL,8,Fespecially in the southeast.
OL,9,FElsewhere, mainly dry with clear
OL,10,Fspells, allowing a local frost to
OL,11,Fdevelop with a few fog patches
OL,12,Fpossible across the north.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FMist and fog patches in the
OL,15,Fnorth clearing. Otherwise, variable
OL,16,Fcloud with scattered light showers,
OL,17,Fmost frequent in the far southeast.
OL,18,FModerate winds in the south and
OL,19,Ftemperatures near normal.
